{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Red Passport: Ticket to Russia \u2014 an adventure game that takes you to the heart of Russia! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/3362ae4175f817504546c2bafdb5235d.poster.avif?t=1769806212\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/3362ae4175f817504546c2bafdb5235d.webm?t=1769806212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/3362ae4175f817504546c2bafdb5235d.mp4?t=1769806212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in a cozy apartment, where the first puzzles set the stage for your epic quest. Pack your bags, head to the airport, and board a plane to a new city. But that\u2019s just the start \u2014 an unforgettable train ride across Russia\u2019s vast landscapes awaits, leading you to Vladivostok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/5ef9329db9de4ee3b11cc1483533cc68.poster.avif?t=1769806212\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/5ef9329db9de4ee3b11cc1483533cc68.webm?t=1769806212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/5ef9329db9de4ee3b11cc1483533cc68.mp4?t=1769806212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Story: Unravel mysteries and stories hidden at every step of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Locations: From an atmospheric city apartment to a bustling airport, a plane, and an iconic train.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Challenges: Use your wits to overcome obstacles and progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural Immersion: Experience Russia\u2019s essence through detailed landscapes, sounds, and unique elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/a450cfd725c2ef1081b3fcbee85141f5.poster.avif?t=1769806212\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/a450cfd725c2ef1081b3fcbee85141f5.webm?t=1769806212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833430/extras/a450cfd725c2ef1081b3fcbee85141f5.mp4?t=1769806212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Passport: Ticket to Russia is a journey full of discoveries, where every step brings you closer to your destination. Can you reach Vladivostok and uncover all its secrets?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Home Stash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833430/3a514dc77a1c18f6dd2b2b2c682a094d8301a60d.jpg"},{"name":"Passport Panic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833430/f713fb73886b989fd1c4c8393e4b8d5dccf650f4.jpg"},{"name":"Good Deeds Department","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833430/fbd13cc398b437ed8b14563398cacb8bd5cf0cff.jpg"},{"name":"Where\u2019s My Money?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833430/205ce2ed3c667eb4ad3e0776ccdb8c250b11b8fe.jpg"},{"name":"Tick